' =====================================================================
' RoboFetch - Scenario 2 of 3: an order is REFUSED because the robot
' does not have the battery to finish it. Nothing is stored and the
' robot is never sent, so the refusal costs nothing but a preview.
' The reason string is the one the system really produces.
' =====================================================================
@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #34495E
  LifeLineBorderColor #7F8C8D
  ParticipantBorderColor #34495E
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FBFCFE
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #EAF2FA
}

title Scenario 2: an order is refused on the robot's condition

actor Controller as C
participant "Web tier" as API
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "AI service" as AI
participant "Task manager" as TM

== Cost the job ==
C -> API ++ : POST /preview  SKU-3001 -> delivery_1
API -> DB ++ : product, pick point, bay
DB --> API -- : 4.5 kg, route 8.6 m including the way home
API -> DB ++ : live robot condition
DB --> API -- : battery 18%, 41 C, condition 99%
API -> API : roll the state forward past work\nalready accepted but not yet done

== Ask the model, then decide ==
API -> AI ++ : predict  battery 18%, 4.5 kg, 8.6 m
AI --> API -- : infeasible, confidence 54%
API -> API : apply policy gates:\nstock, reserve, thermal, condition
API --> C -- : REFUSED\n"predicted infeasible in the robot's\ncurrent condition (confidence 54%)"

note over API, TM
  Nothing is written to the orders table and nothing is published to the
  task manager. The robot is never sent, so a refusal costs one preview.
end note

@enduml
